[ti:Iltija Jor-Aazmaish]
[ar:VESAHE · hkfaduio]
[al:Sanatan & Devotional]
[by:Radio Vaigyaaniq — draft timing, unverified]
[00:08.00]Om Mani Padme Hum...
[00:14.94]Síocháin... síocháin...
[00:21.88]---
[00:28.82]Har taraf uzr hai, har su iltija ki bheed hai,
[00:35.77]Zindagi guzar rahi sabki jor-aazmaish mein.
[00:42.71]...jor-aazmaish mein... jor-aazmaish mein...
[00:49.65]Teri surat nahi dekhi hoti achha hota,
[00:56.59]Ab nahi neend teri achchi niyat ki khwahish mein.
[01:03.53]...khwahish mein... khwahish mein...
[01:10.47]---
[01:17.41]Naam bas ek rah gaya saans ki gunjaish mein,
[01:24.36]Zindagi guzar rahi sabki jor-aazmaish mein.
[01:31.30]Ahhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhh...
[01:38.24]Om Ah Hum...
[01:45.18]Kuch khamoshi thi pehle rooh ke sukoon mein,
[01:52.12]Ab lagi rehti hai jaane kis paimaish mein.
[01:59.06]---
[02:06.00]Nikhal bahe jab kaghaz par dil ke kuch riste ghaav,
[02:12.95]To laga mohabbat ek jua hai, rooh lagi hai daav mein.
[02:19.89]...rooh lagi hai daav mein... rooh lagi hai daav mein...
[02:26.83]Tere mil ke bichhadne ke baad, ek bas aarzu hai sukoon ki,
[02:33.77]Baat mohabbat tak theek thi, par ab baat hai junoon ki.
[02:40.71]...junoon ki... junoon ki...
[02:47.65]Aaaaaaaaaa...
[02:54.60]---
[03:01.54]Na koi fariyaad, na cheekh, na siski...
[03:08.48]Sirf rooh ki khamoshi hai.
[03:15.42]Hindustani: Aaaaaa...
[03:22.36]Arabic: Ooooooo...
[03:29.30]Latin: Eeeeeee...
[03:36.24]Tibetan: Uuuuuuu...
[03:43.19]West African: Aaaaaa...
[03:50.13]Celtic: Iiiiiii...
[03:57.07]Toota dil so tootne de... achha hai... khatam behoshi hai.
[04:04.01]Mera saaya tak cheekhta tha... tere naam ki kaisi madhoshi hai?
[04:10.95]---
[04:17.89]Rooh ki khamoshi hai... sirf rooh ki khamoshi hai...
[04:24.83]La la la... la la la...
[04:31.78]Om.........................
[04:38.72]Allah... Allah... Allah...
[04:45.66]Khamoshi...
